    "notes": "No SCIM endpoint is documented for Commvault Cloud (Command Center / CommCell) users: the 11.46 docs sitemap (9,933 pages) and the API reference sitemap (6,803 pages) contain no SCIM page outside Data Access Manager. Data Access Manager (the former Satori data-security product) does accept SCIM from Okta, Entra ID, OneLogin, JumpCloud and Google Workspace for its own users and groups, with a provisioning URL and access token from the Satori management console and custom attributes under urn:ietf:params:scim:schemas:extension:satoricustom:2.0:User; that product is sold separately and is not scored here."
  },
